        "content": "```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Host as CPU (Host)\n    participant Device as GPU (Device)\n    Host->>Host: 初始化数据\n    Host->>Device: cudaMemcpy (数据传输到 GPU)\n    Host->>Device: kernel<<<grid, block>>>() 启动\n    Device->>Device: 数千线程并行执行\n    Device->>Host: cudaMemcpy (结果传回 CPU)\n    Host->>Host: 后续处理\n```",
        "truncated": false,
